_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-weishu058-yang-010","subject_person_id":"ij6_2nr_3gc","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"m59_oif_ju9","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"顥子領軍將軍冠受"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p011","quote":"及車駕南還，顥令蕭衍將陳慶之守北中城，自據南岸。有夏州義士為顥守河中渚，乃密信通款，求破橋立效，尒朱榮率軍赴之。及橋破，應接不果，皆為顥所屠滅。榮因悵然，將為還計，欲更圖後舉。侃曰：「未審明大王發并州之日，已知有夏州義士指來相應，為欲廣申經略，寧復帝基乎？夫兵散而更合，瘡愈而更戰，持此收功，自古不少，豈可以一圖不全，而眾慮頓廢。今事不果，乃是兩賊相殺，則大王之利矣。若今即還，民情失望，去就之心，何由可保？未若召發民材，惟多縛筏，間以舟楫，沿河廣布，令數百里中，皆為渡勢。首尾既遠，顥復知防何處，一旦得渡，必立大功。」榮大笑曰：「黃門即奏行此計。」於是尒朱兆與侃等遂與馬渚諸楊南渡，破顥子領軍將軍冠受，擒之。顥便南走。車駕入都，侃解尚書，正黃門，加征東將軍、金紫光祿大夫。以濟河之功，進爵濟北郡開國公，增邑五百戶，復除其長子師沖為祕書郎。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p011:m0299","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p011:m0006"}],"interpretation_note":"明顥子，所謂被擒不是死亡。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p011:m0299","start":299,"end":301,"surface":"冠受","kind":"person","person_id":"ij6_2nr_3gc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"破顥子領軍將軍冠受擒之，前主元顥明；不按領軍職推他人。","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p011","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-weishu058-yang-010","subject_